{
 "title": "Rob-Art V4 house",
 "vo": {
  "lines": [
   {
    "id": "hook",
    "text": "$349 a month for a brand new kitchen remodel. That's less than what most New Jersey homeowners spend on their car payment, gym membership, and takeout coffee combined.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "text": "And yet people keep putting off remodeling their kitchen because they think they can't afford it.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "text": "Here's the reality.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "text": "You can afford it.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "text": "You just need to stop thinking about it as a $19,995 one-time payment and start thinking about it as $349 a month.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "text": "We offer flexible financing at Rob-Art Design, which means you can get a fully custom kitchen remodel at a monthly payment that fits your budget with zero pressure to have it all up front.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b6",
    "text": "We'll sit down with you, walk you through different design options at different price points, and show you exactly what the monthly payment looks like based on what you choose.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b7",
    "text": "We've been remodeling kitchens for New Jersey homeowners since 2012, and every project comes with a 12-month workmanship warranty on everything we build.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "cta",
    "text": "Click Get Quote Below and let's get your new kitchen started.",
    "after": 0.05
   }
  ],
  "engine": "elevenlabs",
  "voice": "Michael (ElevenLabs v4, Kysvuk17R9MDAP9l089v)",
  "take": "pEgottleAC7E03BxR4b5",
